<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταναίω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make to dwell, settle</i>:—
				Act.
			 only in poet. aor., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατένασσε πατὴρ ἐς πείρατα γαίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					168
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὑπὸ Χθονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γουνοῖσιν Νεμείης</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				329
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				B.
				3.60
			</span></i>:—aor.
			
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσαρέστους δαίμονας αὐτοῦ
					κατανασσαμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					929
				</span></i>
			 (anap.):—
				Pass.
			, only in aor., <i>take up one's abode,
			dwell</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ δειράσι Παρνασοῦ κατενάσθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					207
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ Χώρᾳ
			κατένασθεν</span> (3pl.) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				662
			</span></i>: so in aor.
			
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Κέῳ κατενάσσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.520
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>establish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					10.41
				</span></i>
			.</div>
